OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fevening with some sunshine. The rest
OL,7,Fof the night will then remain dry for
OL,8,Fmost with lengthy clear spells and
OL,9,Flight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA mainly dry, bright day with
OL,12,Fplenty of warm sunny spells. Sunshine
OL,13,Fwill turn a little hazy at times
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,17,Fwarm or very warm period with a good
OL,18,Fdeal of dry and bright weather. Just
OL,19,Fthe risk of the odd shower on
OL,20,FWednesday and Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
